; the dhcp client service, mime's own dhcpcore.dll in svchost -k LocalServiceNetworkRestricted, as windows 11 registers
; it but for the name of dhcpcore6.dll under Parametersv6: mime's library holds the dhcpv6 half itself. it serves the
; lease queries of dhcpcsvc6.dll, where GetAdaptersAddresses takes the dhcpv6 identifiers of an adapter from. the leases
; of ipv4 are the host's and dhcpcsvc.dll reads them without the service.
